# 当前本机 YAML 配置使用 18080；其他环境按实际端口修改。
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8088
# 从已完成 /access/insert 的登录会话获取访问令牌；不要把实际令牌保存到仓库。
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACTIVE_SESSION_ACCESS_TOKEN

### 查询可选处理器（配置白名单）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/job-handlers/select
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 创建手动任务；将响应中的 id 和 configVersion 用于下方写请求
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/insert
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "手动演示任务",
  "handlerKey": "demoSuccess",
  "payload": {"batchSize": 100}
}

### 分页查询
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/select?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询详情，替换为实际 id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/selectById?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 修改：替换为实际 id 和最新版本，job 为完整配置
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/update
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "configVersion": 1,
  "job": {
    "name": "定时演示任务",
    "handlerKey": "demoSuccess",
    "payload": {"batchSize": 200},
    "scheduleType": "CRON",
    "cronExpression": "0 */5 * * * *",
    "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai",
    "enabled": false,
    "timeoutSeconds": 30,
    "maxAttempts": 3,
    "retryIntervalSeconds": 5,
    "misfirePolicy": "SKIP"
  }
}

### 启用：替换为实际 id 和最新版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "configVersion": 2}

### 停用：替换为实际 id 和最新版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "configVersion": 3}

### 删除：软删除，替换为实际 id 和最新版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/delete
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"id": 1, "configVersion": 4}

### 查询任务数量
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/selectSummary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 预览每天北京时间九点的触发时间
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/jobs/preview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cronExpression": "0 0 9 * * *",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Shanghai",
  "from": "2026-10-26T00:00:00Z",
  "count": 2
}

### 创建手动运行：使用尚未删除任务的真实 id/version；网络重试保留 requestKey，另一次执行才换新 UUID
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/insert
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": 1,
  "configVersion": 1,
  "requestKey": "84f1ab0f-c5d8-4ba0-8708-0d1a7737323a"
}

### 按原提交标识确认是否已接收
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/selectByRequestKey?requestKey=84f1ab0f-c5d8-4ba0-8708-0d1a7737323a
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 查询任务运行历史，jobId 按实际值修改
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/select?jobId=1&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 将 id 替换为创建运行接口返回的 id，可查看配置快照与每次 Attempt
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/runs/selectById?id=00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
